		html: `<p class="eyebrow text-[11px] tracking-[2.4px] font-bold text-muted leading-[1.5] mobile:text-[9px] mobile:tracking-[1.6px]">04 / COMPARAR UN VALOR CONTRA VARIOS CASOS</p><h2>Un valor.<br><span>Muchos caminos posibles.</span></h2><div class="mode-demo grid grid-cols-[0.9fr_1.2fr] gap-[65px] items-center tablet:gap-[30px] mobile:grid-cols-[1fr] mobile:gap-[23px]"><div class="mode-left flex items-center flex-col gap-[18px] mobile:gap-[13px]"><div class="segmented inline-flex [background:#e8edf2] rounded-[6px] gap-[4px] p-[4px] border border-solid border-[#cbd6df] [&_button]:rounded-[3px] [&_button]:[background:none] [&_button]:text-[12px] [&_button]:py-[10px] [&_button]:px-[18px] [&_button]:border-[0] [&_button]:border-none [&_button]:border-[currentColor] [&_button[aria-pressed=true]]:[background:white] [&_button[aria-pressed=true]]:[box-shadow:0_1px_4px_#30496815] [&_button[aria-pressed=true]]:text-blue" role="group" aria-label="Elegir el tamaño del pedido"><button data-size="chico" aria-pressed="true">Chico</button><button data-size="mediano" aria-pressed="false">Mediano</button><button data-size="grande" aria-pressed="false">Grande</button><button data-size="otro" aria-pressed="false">Otro</button></div><div class="switch-result w-[255px] min-h-[160px] rounded-[14px] [background:#fff] [box-shadow:0_12px_28px_#2d4b6510] flex flex-col justify-center items-center gap-[10px] p-[22px] border border-solid border-[#c5d3df] mobile:w-[240px]"><span class="eyebrow text-[11px] tracking-[2.4px] font-bold text-muted leading-[1.5] mobile:text-[9px] mobile:tracking-[1.6px]">PRECIO</span><b id="switch-price" class="text-[40px] text-blue">$800</b></div><p class="feedback text-[14px] min-h-[23px] text-blue text-center [&.success]:text-[#286247] [&.incorrect]:text-[#9e4f24]" id="switch-feedback" aria-live="polite">Coincide con el case "chico": precio 800.</p></div><div class="flow-code [background:#23364b] text-[#e3ebf2] rounded-[7px] py-[25px] px-0 [&>.code-label]:py-0 [&>.code-label]:px-[25px] [&_pre]:text-[clamp(15px,1.6vw,22px)] [&_pre_span]:block [&_pre_span]:[border-left-width:3px] [&_pre_span]:[border-left-style:solid] [&_pre_span]:[border-left-color:transparent] [&_pre_span]:[transition:background_0.3s] [&_pre_span]:py-[3px] [&_pre_span]:px-[25px] [&_.active-line]:[background:#426078] [&_.active-line]:[border-left-color:#e5a05d] mobile:py-[20px] mobile:px-0 mobile:[&_pre]:text-[15px] mobile:[&_pre_span]:py-[2px] mobile:[&_pre_span]:px-[20px]"><span class="code-label block text-[9px] tracking-[1.6px] text-[#a6b8c8] mb-[18px]">JAVASCRIPT</span><pre><code><span><em>switch</em> (tamaño) {</span><span id="case-chico" class="active-line">  <em>case</em> <q>"chico"</q>:\n    precio = <b>800</b>;\n    <em>break</em>;</span><span id="case-mediano">  <em>case</em> <q>"mediano"</q>:\n    precio = <b>1000</b>;\n    <em>break</em>;</span><span id="case-grande">  <em>case</em> <q>"grande"</q>:\n    precio = <b>1200</b>;\n    <em>break</em>;</span><span id="case-default">  <em>default</em>:\n    precio = <b>1000</b>;</span><span>}</span></code></pre></div></div>`,
